@baseUrl=http://localhost:8080


### user-list
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### user-info
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### user-regist
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "xxx",
  "email": "hong@mail.com",
  "coMail": "hong@hanabank.com",
  "tel": "010-123-5678",
  "creditCard": "1234 1234 5678 5678"
}


### user-update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "username": "Hong",
  "email": "hong@gmail.com",
  "tel": "010-1234-5678"
}

### user-withdraw
DELETE {{baseUrl}}//users/1
